msgstr "No audio file."

#. module: bf_capture
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_capture/models/bf_capture.py:0
msgid "Aucun son reçu."
msgstr "No sound received."

#. module: bf_capture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_capture.res_config_settings_view_form_capture
msgid "Captation audio"
msgstr "Audio capture"

#. module: bf_capture
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_capture.model_bf_capture
msgid "Captation audio mobile"
msgstr "Mobile audio capture"

#. module: bf_capture
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_capture.model_res_config_settings
msgid "Config Settings"
msgstr "Config Settings"

#. module: bf_capture
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_capture/models/bf_capture.py:0
msgid "Date de début illisible : %s"
msgstr "Unreadable start time: %s"

#. module: bf_capture
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_capture.field_res_config_settings__bf_capture_folder
msgid ""
"Dossier Nextcloud surveillé par le processeur de rencontres, relatif à la "
"racine du compte de la configuration Nextcloud (par exemple « Transcriptions"
" »)."
msgstr "Nextcloud folder watched by the meeting processor, relative to the root of the account in the Nextcloud configuration (for example “Transcriptions”)."

#. module: bf_capture
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_capture.field_res_config_settings__bf_capture_folder
msgid "Dossier de dépôt"
msgstr "Deposit folder"

#. module: bf_capture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_capture.res_config_settings_view_form_capture
msgid "Dossier surveillé"
msgstr "Watched folder"

#. module: bf_capture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_capture.res_config_settings_view_form_capture
msgid "Dépôt des rencontres"
msgstr "Meeting deposit"

#. module: bf_capture
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_capture/models/bf_capture.py:0
msgid "Enregistrement trop volumineux (%(recu)s, maximum %(max)s)."
msgstr "Recording too large (%(recu)s, maximum %(max)s)."

#. module: bf_capture
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_capture/controllers/mobile_api.py:0
msgid "Format non reconnu : %s"
msgstr "Unrecognised format: %s"

#. module: bf_capture
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_capture/models/bf_capture.py:0
msgid ""
"Il faut une rencontre ou un titre : c'est le nom du fichier qui dit au "
"processeur de quel client il s'agit."
msgstr "A meeting or a title is required: the filename is what tells the processor which client this is."

#. module: bf_capture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_capture.res_config_settings_view_form_capture
msgid ""
"L'enregistrement part vers le dossier Nextcloud que surveille le processeur "
"de rencontres. Le nom du fichier est composé ici, à partir de l'événement au"
" calendrier."
msgstr "The recording goes to the Nextcloud folder watched by the meeting processor. The filename is composed here, from the calendar event."

#. module: bf_capture
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_capture.field_res_config_settings__bf_capture_memo_max_bytes
msgid ""
"Le mémo passe par la dictée : au-delà de son propre plafond, le "
"téléversement serait refusé plus loin, après coup."
msgstr "A memo goes through dictation: past its own limit the upload would be refused further down the line, after the fact."

#. module: bf_capture
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_capture/models/bf_capture.py:0
msgid ""
"Mémo trop long (%(recu)s, maximum %(max)s). Au-delà, c'est une rencontre : "
"elle se dépose par l'autre porte."
msgstr "Memo too long (%(recu)s, maximum %(max)s). Beyond that it is a meeting, and meetings go through the other door."

#. module: bf_capture
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_capture/models/bf_capture.py:0
msgid "Mémo vocal"
msgstr "Voice memo"

#. module: bf_capture
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_capture/models/bf_capture.py:0
msgid "Mémo vocal capté depuis le téléphone."
msgstr "Voice memo captured from the phone."

#. module: bf_capture
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_capture/models/bf_capture.py:0
msgid ""
"Mémo vocal sans transcription : la dictée n'est pas configurée sur cette "
"instance. L'audio est en pièce jointe."
msgstr "Voice memo without a transcription: dictation is not configured on this instance. The audio is attached."

#. module: bf_capture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_capture.res_config_settings_view_form_capture
msgid "Plafonds"
msgstr "Limits"

#. module: bf_capture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_capture.res_config_settings_view_form_capture
msgid ""
"Relatif à la racine du compte de la configuration Nextcloud active. Le "
"processeur y prend les fichiers et les déplace vers son sous-dossier « "
"Traités »."
msgstr "Relative to the root of the active Nextcloud configuration account. The processor picks files up there and moves them into its “Traités” subfolder."

#. module: bf_capture
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_capture/models/bf_capture.py:0
msgid "Rencontre"
msgstr "Meeting"

#. module: bf_capture
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_capture/models/bf_capture.py:0
msgid "Rencontre introuvable."
msgstr "Meeting not found."

#. module: bf_capture
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_capture.field_res_config_settings__bf_capture_memo_max_bytes
msgid "Taille maximale d'un mémo (octets)"
msgstr "Maximum memo size (bytes)"

#. module: bf_capture
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_capture.field_res_config_settings__bf_capture_max_bytes
msgid "Taille maximale d'une rencontre (octets)"
msgstr "Maximum meeting size (bytes)"

#. module: bf_capture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_capture.res_config_settings_view_form_capture
msgid "Transcriptions"
msgstr "Transcriptions"

#. module: bf_capture
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_capture/models/bf_capture.py:0
msgid "Trop d'enregistrements du même nom dans le dossier."
msgstr "Too many recordings with the same name in the folder."

#. module: bf_capture
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_capture.field_res_config_settings__bf_capture_max_bytes
msgid "Une heure d'audio du téléphone pèse environ 5 Mo."
msgstr "One hour of phone audio weighs about 5 MB."
